Thanks - I have this working.
The short explanation is that some of the printers were not set up on the 
Windows print server.
An error was not reported on the Tru64, but the connection remained in a 
TIME_WAIT state on Windows, so when the Tru64 tried to use the same source 
port for another print job, it failed.
The solution was to reduce the timeout on Windows and also to create the 
"missing" printers.

Cheers.


